@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:8000
@jwtToken = paste-token-here

### Health check (public)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Login to obtain a JWT
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "your-username",
  "jelszo": "your-password"
}

### Get current user (replace jwtToken after login)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get all rooms (requires JWT)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get room by id (requires JWT)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List maintenance windows (requires JWT for write operations)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get reliability score (requires JWT)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/reliability/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List master-key access (requires JWT)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/keys/1/master-access
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Accept: application/json
### Health check
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Get all rooms
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Accept: application/json

### Get room by id
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/rooms/1
Accept: application/json
